# Cloudflare Workers Assets — wrangler.jsonc sets assets.directory to ".", so
# every file in the repo is uploaded unless it is listed here.
#
# This file exists because the deploy step fails without it: CI runs
# `npm clean-install` before `npx wrangler deploy`, and node_modules then
# contains @deno/linux-x64-glibc/deno at ~92 MB — well over Cloudflare's
# 25 MiB per-asset limit. Builds have failed since deno joined
# devDependencies on 26 Aug 2026.
#
# Everything else listed here is server-side or internal and was being served
# publicly for no reason: the SQL schema, the build notes and the test suites.
# The site itself needs only the root .html files, assets/, css/, js/ and the
# root kw-*.js — nothing here is referenced at runtime.

node_modules/
tests/
migrations/
docs/
supabase/
email-templates/

*.sql
*.md

package.json
package-lock.json
deno.lock
wrangler.jsonc
browser_rls_test.js
